OL,3,GNEWSACastle display to feature 28,000
OL,4,Ahandmade poppies
OL,5,
OL,6,FA community project has seen more than
OL,7,F28,000 handmade poppies being used to
OL,8,Fcreate a display for Remembrance Day.
OL,10,FThe installation at Southsea Castle in
OL,11,FPortsmouth was knitted and crocheted by
OL,12,Fvolunteers who are also preparing and
OL,13,Fattaching the red flowers.
OL,15,FThe display was led by a local craft
OL,16,Fshop and will be unveiled at 11.30 GMT
OL,17,Fon Friday by the deputy lord mayor of
OL,18,FPortsmouth City Council.
OL,20,FLocal businesses and organisations have
OL,21,Falso had a hand in contributing to the
OL,22,Feffort.
